bee]\n  - v4.1.stable.official [970459615]\n  - v4.0.stable.official [92bee43ad]\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - integrated AMD Radeon(TM) 780M (Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.; 31.0.22024.17002) - AMD Ryzen 7 7840HS w/ Radeon 780M Graphics (16 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe setting, `editors/polygon_editor/point_grab_radius`, does not have any effect on the point radius in the Polygon Editor, visual or for the clickable area.\n\nThe default value is 16, and changing it to any other value does not change anything (I've tested 1, 10, 80, 100, 200, 1000, and some other values).\n\nAdditionally, reloading the project, editor, etc. does not change anything.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Open a Polygon2D node to see current point size\n2. Go to `Editor` -> `Editor Settings...`\n3. Search for \"Point Grab Radius\"\n4. change the Point Grab Radius setting, and it will have no visible effect on the point size in the Polygon2D node\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20429044/test.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_